{"author":{"id":"0fb62b7075a4219f84b4bf8c9c235af1632f3fa4b63ca899f025ad8215a930fd"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1778063279,"nonce":"Kd48df/hzgu/sOaWbqo4J2FhBE8=","title":"Share institution_labels and language_labels across TEPS repos","message":"`institution_labels` (and `language_labels`) are duplicated across at least two\nlocations:\n\n- `TEPS_master/app/browser/R/helpers.R`\n- `TEPS_course_content_harvest/app/course_browser/R/helpers.R`\n\nWhen the institution list drifts (new institution added, short code renamed,\ndisplay label changed) every copy must be updated in lockstep, and there is\nnothing enforcing this.\n\n## Possible fixes\n\n1. Tiny shared R package (e.g. `tepsmeta`) installed from a TEPS repo, exporting\n   `institution_labels`, `language_labels`, and any future shared lookups.\n2. A canonical CSV (e.g. `institutions.csv`) committed in one repo and read by\n   both apps at load time. Lower friction, no package install step.\n\n## Where to look\n\nGrep for `institution_labels \u003c- c(` across the TEPS_* repos before editing\neither copy.\n\nFiled from `TEPS_master/app/browser/R/helpers.R` — see the `TODO(shared-labels)`\ncomment there for the in-code anchor.","files":null}]}